   "source": [
    "# 02 - Metode Klasik: Color Histogram & HOG\n",
    "### Proyek Kelompok Pengolahan Citra Digital (PCD) 2026 · Topik T5\n",
    "**Tahap 2 · Penilaian UAS (Bobot 30%)**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tujuan Notebook:**\n",
    "1. Mengimplementasikan **Metode Klasik 1**: Ekstraksi Histogram Warna 3D (Color Histogram).\n",
    "2. Mengimplementasikan **Metode Klasik 2**: Ekstraksi Histogram of Oriented Gradients (HOG) untuk menangkap tepi dan siluet pakaian.\n",
    "3. Menghitung jarak kemiripan citra menggunakan **Cosine Distance**.\n",
    "4. Menghasilkan visualisasi Top-10 pencarian gambar serupa dan mengukur metrik awal (**Precision@10**)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Import Library & Modul Proyek"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import glob\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from PIL import Image\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# Impor modul buatan dari folder pcd_proyek/\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.append('..')\n",
    "from pcd_proyek.classic import extract_color_histogram, extract_hog_features\n",
    "from pcd_proyek.metrics import precision_at_k\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Modul pcd_proyek berhasil diimpor!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Ekstraksi Fitur Metode Klasik 1: Color Histogram (3D RGB Bins)\n",
    "Histogram warna memetakan sebaran distribusi warna merah, hijau, dan biru pada pakaian."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sample_dir = '../data/sample'\n",
    "sample_images = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(sample_dir, '*.jpg')))\n",
    "\n",
    "color_features = []\n",
    "image_names = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for path in sample_images:\n",
    "    vec = extract_color_histogram(path, bins=(8, 8, 8))\n",
    "    color_features.append(vec)\n",
    "    image_names.append(os.path.basename(path))\n",
    "\n",
    "color_features = np.vstack(color_features)\n",
    "print(f\"Matriks Fitur Color Histogram terekstraksi: {color_features.shape} (Citra x 512 Dimensi)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Ekstraksi Fitur Metode Klasik 2: Histogram of Oriented Gradients (HOG)\n",
    "HOG memetakan distribusi orientasi gradien tepi untuk mengenali bentuk garis kerah, lengan, dan potongan busana."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "hog_features = []\n",
    "for path in sample_images:\n",
    "    vec = extract_hog_features(path)\n",
    "    hog_features.append(vec)\n",
    "\n",
    "hog_features = np.vstack(hog_features)\n",
    "print(f\"Matriks Fitur HOG terekstraksi: {hog_features.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Pencarian Kemiripan Citra & Evaluasi Top-K"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Menguji pencarian menggunakan gambar query pertama\n",
    "query_idx = 0\n",
    "query_feat = color_features[query_idx]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Cosine Similarity (Dot product vektor ternormalisasi)\n",
    "similarity_scores = np.dot(color_features, query_feat)\n",
    "top_indices = np.argsort(similarity_scores)[::-1][:6]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Query: {image_names[query_idx]}\")\n",
    "print(\"Top Rekomendasi (Metode Color Histogram):\")\n",
    "for rank, idx in enumerate(top_indices, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"{rank}. {image_names[idx]} (Skor: {similarity_scores[idx]*100:.2f}%)\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
